    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If you think all boys dream of being "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "superheroes",
            "zh": "超级英雄"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "astronauts",
            "ref": "v-astronaut"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", think again. In a small village in the U.K., a little boy named Archie wants to be a super farmer. He wants to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " one million chickens on his land."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Archie loves chickens more than most kids love toys. His family even "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rented",
            "ref": "v-rent"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "field",
            "ref": "v-field"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for him. With help from his parents and older "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "siblings",
            "zh": "兄弟姐妹"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", he now "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about 50 chickens. Each morning before school, he goes to the field with great excitement. He runs "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to his favorite "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "hen",
            "zh": "母鸡"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Nugget, with a bright smile. Archie believes she might even be the biggest chicken in the whole "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "universe",
            "zh": "宇宙"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Archie says his love for farming started "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " his bedroom window faces big, open fields. When he learned that some chickens lived in poor conditions, he wanted to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The family started with just five chickens in their small garden, but the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " quickly grew. In October, they moved to a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " field. A local shop now sells their eggs. Archie "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " every coin he "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "earns",
            "ref": "v-earn"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". One day, he hopes to buy his own "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He even wants to build a “chicken "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fortress",
            "zh": "堡垒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When he was asked again "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " chickens he would like to have, Archie laughed and said, “Two "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trillion",
            "zh": "万亿"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” before changing into his school uniform. Tomorrow, he will be back with his "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flock",
            "zh": "鸡群"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " again."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
